div(class="space-y-8")
    div(*ngIf="mode === 'list'", class="space-y-6")
        header(class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-b border-slate-200 pb-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between")
            div
                p(class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-orange-600") Service providers
                h2(class="mt-1.5 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950") SP 관리
                p(class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600") Metadata를 등록하고 표준 상태, ACS, SLO, 인증서를 한눈에 확인합니다.
            button(type="button", class="h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-500 px-4 text-sm font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-orange-600", (click)="showRegister()") SP 등록

        div(class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3")
            div(class="rounded-xl border border-orange-200 bg-orange-50 p-4")
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-orange-700") 등록된 SP
                p(class="mt-1 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-950") {{spList.length}}
            div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 sm:col-span-2")
                p(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") 등록 기준
                p(class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600") XML 최대 256KB, 최대 50개입니다. 서명 또는 암호화 인증서가 없으면 상세 화면에 호환 시험으로 표시됩니다.

        div(*ngIf="loading", class="flex min-h-[16rem] items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50")
            p(class="text-sm text-slate-500") SP 목록을 불러오는 중...

        div(*ngIf="!loading && spList.length === 0", class="rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 p-10 text-center")
            h3(class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-800") 등록된 SP가 없습니다.
            p(class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500") SP Metadata XML을 등록하면 상태와 endpoint를 확인할 수 있습니다.
            button(type="button", class="mt-4 rounded-xl bg-orange-500 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white", (click)="showRegister()") 첫 SP 등록

        div(*ngIf="!loading && spList.length > 0", class="space-y-3")
            article(*ngFor="let sp of spList", class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 transition hover:border-orange-200 hover:shadow-sm")
                div(class="flex flex-col gap-4 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between")
                    button(type="button", class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-left", (click)="showDetail(sp)")
                        p(class="break-all text-sm font-bold leading-6 text-slate-950 group-hover:text-orange-700") {{sp.entity_id}}
                        div(class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2")
                            span(class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold", [class]="sp.flags?.standards_status === 'standard' ? 'bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700' : 'bg-amber-50 text-amber-700'") {{sp.flags?.standards_status === 'standard' ? '표준' : '호환 시험'}}
                            span(class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600") ACS {{sp.acs_url?.length || 0}}
                            span(class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium", [class]="sp.flags?.has_slo ? 'bg-sky-50 text-sky-700' : 'bg-slate-100 text-slate-500'") {{sp.flags?.has_slo ? 'SLO 지원' : 'SLO 없음'}}
                            span(class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium", [class]="sp.flags?.has_signing_cert ? 'bg-violet-50 text-violet-700' : 'bg-amber-50 text-amber-700'") {{sp.flags?.has_signing_cert ? 'Signing 인증서' : 'Signing 인증서 없음'}}
                    div(class="flex shrink-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-2")
                        span(class="text-sm font-medium", [class]="sp.expires && (isExpired(sp.expires) || isExpiringSoon(sp.expires)) ? 'text-rose-600' : 'text-slate-500'") {{getTimeRemaining(sp.expires)}}
                        button(*ngIf="isAdmin() && sp.expires", type="button", class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50", (click)="extendSp(sp)") +24시간
                        button(type="button", class="rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white", (click)="showDetail(sp)") 상세

    div(*ngIf="mode === 'register'", class="space-y-6")
        header(class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-200 pb-4")
            button(type="button", class="rounded-lg p-2 text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-slate-700", aria-label="SP 목록으로", (click)="showList()")
                svg(class="size-4", xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="2", stroke="currentColor")
                    path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18")
            div
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") SP 관리 / 등록
                h2(class="mt-0.5 text-lg font-bold text-slate-950") Metadata XML 등록

        div(class="grid gap-6 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_18rem]")
            div(class="space-y-4")
                label(class="block cursor-pointer rounded-2xl border-2 border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 px-6 py-8 text-center transition hover:border-orange-300 hover:bg-orange-50")
                    input(type="file", accept=".xml,application/xml,text/xml", class="hidden", (change)="onFileUpload($event)")
                    span(class="mx-auto flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white text-orange-600 shadow-sm")
                        svg(class="size-5", xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="1.7", stroke="currentColor")
                            path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M3 16.5v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75V16.5m-13.5-9L12 3m0 0l4.5 4.5M12 3v13.5")
                    strong(class="mt-3 block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800") XML 파일 선택
                    span(class="mt-1 block text-sm text-slate-500") 또는 아래 입력란에 직접 붙여넣으세요.
                label(class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800") Metadata XML
                    textarea([(ngModel)]="xmlInput", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", rows="15", placeholder="<md:EntityDescriptor ...>", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-slate-950 p-4 font-mono text-xs leading-6 text-slate-100 placeholder:text-slate-500 focus:border-orange-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-100")
                div(class="flex justify-end gap-2")
                    button(type="button", class="h-10 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700", [disabled]="registering", (click)="showList()") 취소
                    button(type="button", class="h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-500 px-5 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-orange-600 disabled:opacity-50", [disabled]="registering || !xmlInput.trim()", (click)="registerSp()") {{registering ? '등록 중...' : 'Metadata 확인 후 등록'}}
            aside(class="h-fit rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4")
                h3(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") 등록 전에 확인하세요
                ol(class="mt-3 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600")
                    li(class="flex gap-2")
                        span(class="font-bold text-orange-600") 1.
                        span Entity ID와 ACS URL이 현재 SP 값인지 확인합니다.
                    li(class="flex gap-2")
                        span(class="font-bold text-orange-600") 2.
                        span 서명 검증이 필요하면 Signing 인증서를 포함합니다.
                    li(class="flex gap-2")
                        span(class="font-bold text-orange-600") 3.
                        span EncryptedAssertion 시험에는 Encryption 인증서가 필요합니다.

    div(*ngIf="mode === 'result' && registerResult", class="space-y-6")
        header(class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-200 pb-4")
            span(class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700") ✓
            div
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") SP 관리 / 등록 완료
                h2(class="mt-0.5 text-lg font-bold text-slate-950") Metadata를 등록했습니다.
        div(*ngIf="registerResult.warnings?.length", class="rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-4")
            p(class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-900") 확인이 필요한 항목
            ul(class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-amber-800")
                li(*ngFor="let warning of registerResult.warnings") {{warning}}
        div(class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2")
            div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 lg:col-span-2")
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400") Entity ID
                p(class="mt-2 break-all text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") {{registerResult.entity_id}}
            div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                p(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") ACS endpoint
                div(*ngIf="registerResult.acs_url?.length", class="mt-3 space-y-2")
                    div(*ngFor="let acs of registerResult.acs_url", class="grid grid-cols-[4.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-2")
                        span(class="rounded bg-orange-50 px-2 py-1 text-center text-xs font-semibold text-orange-700") {{getBindingShort(acs.binding)}}
                        span(class="break-all text-sm text-slate-600") {{acs.location}}
                p(*ngIf="!registerResult.acs_url?.length", class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500") 없음
            div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                p(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") SLO endpoint
                div(*ngIf="registerResult.slo_url?.length", class="mt-3 space-y-2")
                    div(*ngFor="let slo of registerResult.slo_url", class="grid grid-cols-[4.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-2")
                        span(class="rounded bg-sky-50 px-2 py-1 text-center text-xs font-semibold text-sky-700") {{getBindingShort(slo.binding)}}
                        div(class="space-y-1")
                            p(class="break-all text-sm text-slate-600") {{slo.location}}
                            p(*ngIf="slo.response_location", class="break-all text-xs text-slate-500") 응답: {{slo.response_location}}
                p(*ngIf="!registerResult.slo_url?.length", class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500") 없음
        div(class="flex justify-end")
            button(type="button", class="rounded-xl bg-slate-900 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white", (click)="showList()") SP 목록으로

    div(*ngIf="mode === 'detail' && selectedSp", class="space-y-6")
        header(class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-200 pb-4")
            button(type="button", class="rounded-lg p-2 text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-slate-700", aria-label="SP 목록으로", (click)="showList()")
                svg(class="size-4", xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="2", stroke="currentColor")
                    path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18")
            div
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") SP 관리 / 상세
                h2(class="mt-0.5 text-lg font-bold text-slate-950") 등록 정보

        div(class="grid gap-4 xl:grid-cols-[18rem_minmax(0,1fr)]")
            aside(class="space-y-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6 xl:sticky xl:top-[4.75rem] xl:self-start")
                div
                    p(class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400") 선택한 SP
                    h3(class="mt-2 break-all text-sm font-bold leading-6 text-slate-950") {{selectedSp.entity_id}}
                div(class="flex flex-wrap gap-2")
                    span(class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold", [class]="selectedSp.flags?.standards_status === 'standard' ? 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800' : 'bg-amber-100 text-amber-800'") {{selectedSp.flags?.standards_status === 'standard' ? '표준' : '호환 시험'}}
                    span(class="rounded-full bg-white px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 ring-1 ring-slate-200") ACS {{selectedSp.acs_url?.length || 0}}
                    span(class="rounded-full bg-white px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 ring-1 ring-slate-200") {{selectedSp.flags?.has_slo ? 'SLO 지원' : 'SLO 없음'}}
                div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3")
                    p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") 유효 시간
                    p(class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") {{getTimeRemaining(selectedSp.expires)}}
                    p(*ngIf="selectedSp.expires", class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500") {{selectedSp.expires | date:'yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm'}}
                div(*ngIf="isAdmin() && selectedSp.expires", class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2")
                    button(type="button", class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700", (click)="extendSp(selectedSp)") +24시간
                    button(type="button", class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700", (click)="setUnlimited(selectedSp)") 무기한
                button(*ngIf="selectedSp.can_delete", type="button", class="w-full rounded-xl border border-rose-200 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-rose-700 hover:bg-rose-50", (click)="deleteSp(selectedSp)") SP 삭제
                p(*ngIf="!selectedSp.can_delete", class="text-center text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500") admin 또는 등록한 IP에서 삭제할 수 있습니다.

            div(class="space-y-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6")
                nav(class="-mx-1 flex gap-1 overflow-x-auto border-b border-slate-200 px-1", aria-label="SP 상세 메뉴")
                    button(type="button", class="shrink-0 border-b-2 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition", [class]="detailTabClass('overview')", (click)="setDetailTab('overview')") 요약
                    button(type="button", class="shrink-0 border-b-2 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition", [class]="detailTabClass('endpoints')", (click)="setDetailTab('endpoints')") Endpoint
                    button(type="button", class="shrink-0 border-b-2 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition", [class]="detailTabClass('attributes')", (click)="setDetailTab('attributes')") Attribute·보안

                div(*ngIf="detailTab === 'overview'", class="space-y-4")
                    div(class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2")
                        div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                            p(class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400") AuthnRequestsSigned
                            p(class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") {{selectedSp.flags?.authn_requests_signed ? 'Yes' : 'No'}}
                        div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                            p(class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400") WantAssertionsSigned
                            p(class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") {{selectedSp.flags?.want_assertions_signed ? 'Yes' : 'No'}}
                    div(class="rounded-xl border p-4", [class]="selectedSp.flags?.standards_status === 'standard' ? 'border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50' : 'border-amber-200 bg-amber-50'")
                        p(class="text-sm font-semibold", [class]="selectedSp.flags?.standards_status === 'standard' ? 'text-emerald-800' : 'text-amber-900'") {{selectedSp.flags?.standards_status === 'standard' ? '표준 설정입니다.' : '호환 시험 항목이 있습니다.'}}
                        ul(*ngIf="selectedSp.flags?.standards_warnings?.length", class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-amber-800")
                            li(*ngFor="let warning of selectedSp.flags.standards_warnings") {{warning}}
                    div(*ngIf="selectedSp.created_by_ip", class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                        p(class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400") 등록 IP
                        p(class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm text-slate-700") {{selectedSp.created_by_ip}}

                div(*ngIf="detailTab === 'endpoints'", class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2")
                    div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                        p(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") ACS endpoint
                        div(*ngIf="selectedSp.acs_url?.length", class="mt-3 space-y-3")
                            div(*ngFor="let acs of selectedSp.acs_url")
                                span(class="rounded bg-orange-50 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-orange-700") {{getBindingShort(acs.binding)}}
                                p(class="mt-1.5 break-all text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600") {{acs.location}}
                    div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                        p(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") SLO endpoint
                        div(*ngIf="selectedSp.slo_url?.length", class="mt-3 space-y-3")
                            div(*ngFor="let slo of selectedSp.slo_url")
                                span(class="rounded bg-sky-50 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-sky-700") {{getBindingShort(slo.binding)}}
                                p(class="mt-1.5 break-all text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600") {{slo.location}}
                                p(*ngIf="slo.response_location", class="mt-1 break-all text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500") 응답: {{slo.response_location}}
                        p(*ngIf="!selectedSp.slo_url?.length", class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500") 등록되지 않음

                div(*ngIf="detailTab === 'attributes'", class="space-y-4")
                    div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                        p(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") NameID Format
                        div(*ngIf="selectedSp.nameid_formats?.length", class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2")
                            span(*ngFor="let format of selectedSp.nameid_formats", class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600") {{format}}
                        p(*ngIf="!selectedSp.nameid_formats?.length", class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500") 등록되지 않음
                    div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                        p(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") Requested Attribute
                        div(*ngIf="selectedSp.requested_attributes?.length", class="mt-3 divide-y divide-slate-100")
                            div(*ngFor="let attribute of selectedSp.requested_attributes", class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-2 text-sm")
                                span(class="break-all text-slate-700") {{attribute.friendly_name || attribute.name}}
                                span(*ngIf="attribute.is_required === 'true'", class="shrink-0 rounded bg-rose-50 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-rose-700") Required
                        p(*ngIf="!selectedSp.requested_attributes?.length", class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500") 등록되지 않음
                    div(class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2")
                        div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                            p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") Signing 인증서
                            p(class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") {{selectedSp.flags?.has_signing_cert ? '등록됨' : '없음'}}
                        div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                            p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") Encryption 인증서
                            p(class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") {{selectedSp.flags?.has_encryption_cert ? '등록됨' : '없음'}}
                    div(*ngIf="selectedSp.certificates?.details?.length", class="space-y-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4")
                        p(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") Metadata credential 해석
                        p(class="text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500") X.509 인증서는 PKI 유효성 판단이 아니라 Metadata가 신뢰한 공개키 운반 용도로 사용합니다.
                        div(*ngFor="let cert of selectedSp.certificates.details", class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3")
                            div(class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2")
                                span(class="rounded-full bg-slate-900 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-white") {{cert.use}}
                                span(*ngFor="let role of cert.accepted_roles", class="rounded-full bg-sky-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-700") {{role}}
                                span(class="text-xs text-slate-500") {{cert.public_key_type}} · {{cert.key_size}} bit
                            p(class="mt-2 break-all font-mono text-[10px] leading-4 text-slate-600") SHA-256 {{cert.sha256}}
